    "Name": "Haze",
    "Details": "Developed as a successor to the Phantom, the Haze is a 40-ton OmniMech designed to deploy and support Magnetic Clamp-equipped ProtoMechs. An Interface Cockpit and XXL engine free enough weight for significantly improved Ferro-Lamellor armor and nearly double the pod space of its predecessor.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Sensors</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
